nts - Order Failure Real-Time rules&apos; THEN [% Busy Events Online By Client (copy) (copy) (copy)_1485765688465281042]&#10;ELSEIF [Parameters].[Y-Right Metric Parameter - Offline Duration (copy)_360850943961858056] = &apos;.    Offline events - Order Failure Compliance rules&apos; THEN [% Busy Events Online By Client (copy) (copy) (copy) (copy)_1485765688465293331]&#10;ELSEIF [Parameters].[Y-Right Metric Parameter - Offline Duration (copy)_360850943961858056] = &apos;.    Offline events - Unreachable Compliance rules&apos; THEN [% Busy Events Online By Client (copy) (copy) (copy) (copy) (copy)_1485765688465309716]&#10;ELSEIF [Parameters].[Y-Right Metric Parameter - Offline Duration (copy)_360850943961858056] = &apos;.    Offline events - Vendor Late Real-Time rules&apos; THEN [% Monitor Rule Unreachable Events Online By Client (copy) (copy)_1485765688492662807]&#10;ELSEIF [Parameters].[Y-Right Metric Parameter - Offline Duration (copy)_360850943961858056] = &apos;.    Offline events - Vendor Late Compliance rules&apos; THEN [% Monitor Rule Unreachable Events Online By Client (copy)_1485765688492646422]&#10;ELSEIF [Parameters].[Y-Right Metric Parameter - Offline Duration (copy)_360850943961858056] = &apos;.    Offline events - Availability Compliance rules&apos; THEN [% Monitor Rule Unreachable Events Online By Client (copy) (copy) (copy)_1485765688492675096]&#10;&#10;END' />
