            <run auto-url='true' fontalignment='1' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/views/AvailabilityMonitor/AvailabilityImpact?%3Aembed=y&amp;amp;%3Aiid=1&amp;amp;%3AisGuestRedirectFromVizportal=y#1&amp;quot;'>https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/views/AvailabilityMonitor/AvailabilityImpact?%3Aembed=y&amp;%3Aiid=1&amp;%3AisGuestRedirectFromVizportal=y#1</run>
            <run>&#10;&#10;A filter for </run>
            <run bold='true'>Delivery Type</run>
            <run> is not applicable here since this is an order-level dimension which cannot be overlayed on the below charts, which are based on vendor schedules</run>
          </formatted-text>
